  Assets:Cash 1000 USD
  Assets:Business:Cash 2000 USD
  Income:Salary -1000 USD
  Income:Business:Consulting -2000 USD
2026-01-03 * "Spending"
  Assets:Cash -100 USD
  Assets:Business:Cash -300 USD
  Expenses:Food 100 USD
  Expenses:Business:Supplies 300 USD
